        "TileImage": "$($repository 1feff565-6f5b-4b63-bed5-cbd8ef773b2d).Image",
        "Description": "Several security guards are serving the role of Sidjan&apos;s private security. There&apos;s no doubt that they&apos;ll get in the way of your mission, so it&apos;s going to be necessary to get rid of them. However, these guards are considered low priority due to the establishment&apos;s lack of knowledge on his true dealings. This means that if other guards go missing, they&apos;ll be replaced by these bodyguards. Take out some of the easier to access guards, and Sidjan&apos;s security will be near zero.",
